@startuml sequence-diagram-UC-001
title Sequence UC-001 Autenticarse — FR-001/FR-002/FR-003
actor Actor
participant "AuthController\n(Adapter)" as Ctrl
participant "RegisterUserUseCase\n/ LoginUseCase" as UC
participant "User\n(Entity)" as Ent
participant "Validator\n(Pure Fabrication)" as Val
participant "UserRepository\n(port)" as Repo
participant "AuthSession\n(Entity)" as Sess
database MariaDB as DB

' Paso 1: evento de sistema entra por el adapter
Actor -> Ctrl : POST /auth/register|/login {email, password}
' GRASP Controller — Mission: single entry point per system operation, UI stays thin
Ctrl -> UC : execute(dto)
' GRASP Pure Fabrication — Mission: protect domain cohesion; reglas fuera de User
UC -> Val : validateEmail + validatePassword (BR-003)
Val --> UC : ok / 400
' GRASP Creator — Mission: one stable owner per lifecycle, no scattered new
UC -> Ent : create(data) [registro]
' GRASP Information Expert — Mission: co-locate behavior with information
Ent -> Sess : verify(password, passwordHash) [login, BCrypt>=10, NFR-003]
Sess --> UC : ok / 401
' GRASP Indirection — Mission: both sides depend on something stable
UC -> Repo : save(user) / findByEmail(email)
Repo -> DB : INSERT / SELECT (RST-004)
DB --> Repo : ok
Repo --> UC : User
' GRASP Information Expert — AuthSession firma lo que conoce (userId, role, exp<=24h)
UC -> Sess : sign(userId, role)
Sess --> UC : JWT
UC --> Ctrl : {token} (nunca password, NFR-004)
Ctrl --> Actor : 201/200 con JWT

note over Ctrl, UC : Clean 4: Frameworks/Adapters -> UseCases -> Entities (solo hacia adentro)
@enduml
